WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:05.180
Dear Fellow Scholars, this is Two Minute Papers
with Károly Zsolnai-Fehér.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:08.830
A quick report on what is going on with Two
Minute Papers.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:14.780
We are living extremely busy times as I am
still working full time as a doctoral researcher,

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:19.620
and we also have a baby on the way. We are
currently a bit over 30 episodes in, and I

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:25.000
am having an amazing time explaining these concepts and enjoying the ride tremendously.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:30.290
One of the most beautiful aspects of Two Minute
Papers is the community forming around it,

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:35.850
with extremely high quality comments and lots
of civil, respectful discussions. I learned

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:39.610
a lot from you Fellow Scholars, thanks for
that! Really awesome!

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:44.440
The growth numbers are looking amazing for
a YouTube channel of this size, and of course,

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.550
any help in publicity is greatly appreciated.
If you're a journalist, and you feel that

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:54.310
this is a worthy cause, please, write about
Two Minute Papers! If you're a not a journalist,

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:56.579
please try showing the series to them!

00:00:56.579 --> 00:01:01.399
Or just show it to your friends - I am sure
that many, many more people would be interested

00:01:01.399 --> 00:01:05.289
in this, and sharing is also a great way to
reach out to new people.

00:01:05.289 --> 00:01:10.469
The Patreon page is also getting lots of generous
support that I would only expect from much,

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:15.740
bigger channels. I don't even know if I deserve
it. But thanks for hanging in there, I feel

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:21.289
really privileged to have supporters like
you Fellow Scholars. You're the best. And,

00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:24.060
we have some amazing times ahead of us.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:27.450
Thanks for watching and for your generous
support, and I'll see you next time!

